            "review_title": "Review at Sushi To",
            "review_text": "Antti A\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam21 contributions\n1\nThe best value for money sushi restaurant in Saigon\nMay 2020\nI have been to this place for over two years now, all the way since I have located in Saigon. Found it randomly with Google and lucky I did. They have friendly service, wide selection of Japanese seafood dishes with affordable place. Can't imagine finding better culinary experience with this price. With the prices provided in D1 Sushi restaurants, you easily cover taxi ride to Sushi To and get better food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 8, 2020",
